# 基准路线：营地里走一圈（town），再出南门进血腥荒野走一段（wild）。固定存档、固定地图种子，mark 切段；bench.py 按段出帧时间统计
# Benchmark route: one loop inside the camp (town), then out of the south gate into the Blood Moor for a stretch (wild). Fixed save and map seed; mark cuts the segments; bench.py reports frame-time statistics per segment
name town_loop
save warlock
env DM_GAME_SEED=305419896
timeout 240

enter_game
sleep 2
mark town
walk_to 5789 4470 timeout=20
walk_to 5762 4413 timeout=20
walk_to 5789 4414 timeout=20
walk_to 5789 4495 timeout=20
mark wild
walk_to 5791 4523 timeout=25
expect_state area=2 timeout=10
walk_to 5791 4560 timeout=25
mark end
quit
check no_red
